{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/direction-issued-to-slough-council-childrens-services-october-2014","content_id":"60213d30-7631-11e4-a3cb-005056011aef","description":"Direction issued by the Department for Education to Slough Borough Council to improve performance in children’s social care services.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternative.formats@education.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"5a7d5a97e5274a3356f2bb56","filename":"Direction_for_the_improvement_of_children_s_social_care_services_-_Slough_borough_council.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":90236,"filename":"Direction_for_the_improvement_of_children_s_social_care_services_-_Slough_borough_council.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9280877","isbn":"","number_of_pages":2,"title":"Direction for the improvement of children's social care services: Slough Borough Council (October 2014)","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a7d5a97e5274a3356f2bb56/Direction_for_the_improvement_of_children_s_social_care_services_-_Slough_borough_council.pdf"},{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternative.formats@education.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"5a7df153e5274a2e8ab44d1c","filename":"Edward_Timpson_letter_to_Councillor_Anderson_-_Slough_borough_council.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":128406,"filename":"Edward_Timpson_letter_to_Councillor_Anderson_-_Slough_borough_council.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9280878","isbn":"","number_of_pages":2,"title":"Edward Timpson letter to Councillor Rob Anderson: the direction to Slough Borough Council, October 2014","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a7df153e5274a2e8ab44d1c/Edward_Timpson_letter_to_Councillor_Anderson_-_Slough_borough_council.pdf"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternative.formats@education.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"5a7f1c9540f0b62305b85252","filename":"Letter_to_Slough_Borough_Council_July_2014.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":118477,"filename":"Letter_to_Slough_Borough_Council_July_2014.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9280879","isbn":"","number_of_pages":4,"title":"Edward Timpson letter to Councillor Rob Anderson: Slough children’s social care services independent report, July 2014","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a7f1c9540f0b62305b85252/Letter_to_Slough_Borough_Council_July_2014.pdf"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternative.formats@education.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"5a75830540f0b6397f35eff0","filename":"Ministerial_letter_to_Slough_Council.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":99455,"filename":"Ministerial_letter_to_Slough_Council.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9280880","isbn":"","number_of_pages":2,"title":"Edward Timpson letter to Councillor Rob Anderson: Ofsted's inspection report, March 2014","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a75830540f0b6397f35eff0/Ministerial_letter_to_Slough_Council.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><div class=\"call-to-action\">\n  <p>This first direction is closed and is replaced by a <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/direction-issued-to-slough-borough-council\">revised second direction to Slough Borough Council issued on 1 October 2015</a>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>Children and Families Minister Edward Timpson writes to Slough Borough Council, with an accompanying direction. The direction confirms the appointment of a commissioner to oversee improvement and establish a trust.</p>\n\n<p>The related letters are in response to:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://reports.ofsted.gov.uk/local-authorities/slough\">Ofsted’s inspection report, 11 February 2014</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/slough-childrens-social-care-services-report-to-dfe\">independent report on Slough children’s social care services, 15 July 2014</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"The first direction is closed and was replaced by a revised second direction to Slough Borough Council issued on 1 October 2015. Additional directions are documented in the collection page.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-02T12:21:53Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2014-10-07T11:31:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","emphasised_organisations":["ebd15ade-73b2-4eaf-b1c3-43034a42eb37"],"featured_attachments":["9280877","9280878","9280879","9280880"],"first_public_at":"2014-10-07T12:31:00.000+01:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Wales"}},"political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"correspondence","first_published_at":"2014-10-07T12:31:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/direction-issued-to-slough-council-childrens-services-october-2014","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/direction-issued-to-slough-council-childrens-services-october-2014","base_path":"/government/publications/direction-issued-to-slough-council-childrens-services-october-2014","content_id":"60213d30-7631-